# Everyday MMO life, any realm: leveling moods, loot luck, deaths, mob habits, grouping manners, crafting and
# money, small jokes, boasts and gripes, the hour of the day, new players and old hands, personality types and
# what a bot is doing right now. No place names. New writing for Offline DAoC (see docs/bot-voices).

