# ---------------- Grouping manners ----------------
@kind ambient
@topic grouping
@who *
good groups say hello when you join, it costs nothing
the best groups [i have had|ive been in] [never needed|didnt need] a leader, everyone just knew their job
golden rule: dont break mezz
[please|] dont pull while the healer is [oom|out of power], [its|it is] that simple
a group that says gz on every ding is a group i stay in
asking before you loot is [just good manners|basic manners|common courtesy]
the puller is the most underrated job in any group
[med breaks|power breaks] are part of the game, [let the casters sit|nobody should rush the casters]
i will always wait for a groupmate who has to [go afk|run off] for a minute
groups that split coin and loot fair are worth their weight in gold
you can tell a good tank by how quiet the healer is
i judge a group by how it handles a wipe
if the healer says sit, you sit
nobody remembers the xp, everyone remembers the group
[say|always say] bye before you leave a group, [its|thats] just decent
soloing is fine, but grouping is where the stories come from
[nothing|there is nothing] worse than a pickup group where nobody talks
pickup groups are a gamble, but sometimes you win big
the best groups tell you whats going on before it goes wrong
[assisting|/assist] is the most important button [nobody uses|people forget]
[a good|one good] [puller|pull] can make or break the whole group
[bring|carry] your own [food|potions|arrows] to a group, nobody likes a leech
the group that wipes together laughs together, eventually
